subsidiary of the Guy\u2019s and St. Thomas\u2019 NHS Foundation Trust. The aim is to provide UK public sector bodies with access to low-carbon and zero-carbon technology and infrastructure investments from 27 suppliers.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/1174d253a6bf7030e480317e28f1e61d","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-02-10T13:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"OK19SNCXw","title":"Vodafone UK adds Digitalk to MVNO portfolio","url":"https://www.computerweekly.com/news/252496142/Vodafone-UK-adds-Digitalk-to-MVNO-portfolio","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/vodafone-uk-adds-digitalk-to-mvno-portfolio-ok19sncxw","summary":"Vodafone UK has selected mobile service platform provider Digitalk to provide what it says are the increasingly sophisticated digital experiences needed by customers. The new agreement will see the mobile operator make use of DigitALK\u2019s Mobile Cloud platform to support MVNO partners in providing what it calls highly reliable services. Among the recently announced key partners are Asda and Virgin Media.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/cb63aaca683ab608cc6a90325863ce9e","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-02-10T12:08:00.000Z"},{"id":"Lfgsu7-iv","title":"TCS to recruit 1,500 UK tech professionals this year","url":"https://www.computerweekly.com/news/252496140/TCS-to-recruit-1500-UK-tech-professionals-this-year","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/tcs-to-recruit-1-500-uk-tech-professionals-this-year-lfgsu7-iv","summary":"Indian IT services giant Tata Consultancy Services (TCS) will hire 1,500 IT professionals in the UK this year. The company, which has a UK workforce of more than 20,000, said the jobs will be well paid, including project delivery roles. The announcement followed a meeting in India between TCS CEO Rajesh Gopinathan and UK trade secretary Liz Truss.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/e7691f28eca893e2c8313b22f4818ae4","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-02-10T11:49:00.000Z"},{"id":"fiLBP4zXj","title":"Windows 10, Server 2019 users must patch serious zero-day","url":"https://www.computerweekly.com/news/252496139/Windows-10-Server-2019-users-must-patch-serious-zero-day","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/windows-10-server-2019-users-must-patch-serious-zero-day-filbp4zxj","summary":"The vulnerability, CVE-2021-1732, requires an attacker to have access to the target system in order to exploit it to gain admin rights. It is one of 56 vulnerabilities \u2013 six already disclosed \u2013 to be patched in Microsoft\u2019s February Patch Tuesday update. The final Patch Tuesday of 2020 contains 58 fixes, a minnow compared to some recent drops.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/3d22cd4a5d37032e6024e551ba619ad2","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-02-10T11:36:00.000Z"},{"id":"ZT2RyfLiv","title":"Trend Micro makes Softcat its first UK platinum partner","url":"https://www.computerweekly.com/microscope/news/252496137/Trend-Micro-makes-Softcat-its-first-UK-platinum-partner","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/trend-micro-makes-softcat-its-first-uk-platinum-partner-zt2ryfliv","summary":"Softcat is Trend Micro's first platinum partner in the UK. The reseller has been in the gold tier for many years and is one of the vendor's biggest partners. Trend noted the triple-digit recorded revenue growth year-on-year as well as adding a large number of new logos over 2020.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/365a975f99b744bbaff1fe03ba620375","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-02-10T11:28:00.000Z"},{"id":"fLu6rFa2a","title":"Sim-swapping crooks targeted celebrities, influencers","url":"https://www.computerweekly.com/news/252496135/Sim-swapping-crooks-targeted-celebrities-influencers","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/sim-swapping-crooks-targeted-celebrities-influencers-flu6rfa2a","summary":"Eight men have been arrested in connection with a series of Sim-swapping attacks that targeted athletes, celebrities, musicians and social media influencers. The National Crime Agency (NCA) was able to disrupt a network of UK-based criminals who targeted high-profile victims, stealing personal data, contacts and money.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/f6ad0b55412e0391bcb36ea37404af0c","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-02-10T11:06:00.000Z"},{"id":"tUiij6PgN","title":"Tech sector calls for renewed cooperation in global digital tax talks","url":"https://www.computerweekly.com/news/252496133/Tech-sector-calls-for-renewed-cooperation-in-global-digital-tax-talks","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/tech-sector-calls-for-renewed-cooperation-in-global-digital-tax-talks-tuiij6pgn","summary":"Tech sector bodies are calling for a common approach to taxing the digital economy. They argue that divergence in national digital tax regimes could spark trade disputes. The US has long been opposed to an international digital services tax (DST) proponents of the tax see big technology firms such as Google and Amazon massively benefiting from local markets.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/339fa746006f8a57cb7926186613ad24","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-02-10T10:49:00.000Z"},{"id":"FJ75aCmln","title":"Century-old insurer uses low code as digital demands increase","url":"https://www.computerweekly.com/news/252496074/Century-old-Insurer-uses-low-code-as-digital-demands-increase","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/century-old-insurer-uses-low-code-as-digital-demands-increase-fj75acmln","summary":"Miller Insurance is using low code as demand for software to deliver and support insurance and reinsurance products accelerates in the digital age. Through low code, the 100-year-old company has accelerated and simplified software development to the point where its software development team does not need to request permission to develop.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/e9f6c4e1ccc0fd2e2dd2249f0e412f82","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-02-10T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"0Z_52A6hP","title":"Ducati and Lenovo extend long-standing MotoGP technology deal","url":"https://www.computerweekly.com/news/252496093/Ducati-and-Lenovo-extend-long-standing-MotoGP-technology-deal","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/ducati-and-lenovo-extend-long-standing-motogp-technology-deal-0z-52a6hp","summary":"Ducati MotoGP has signed a three-year deal with long-standing technology partner Lenovo. Deal will see the team double-down on its use of data analytics, artificial intelligence (AI) and edge computing devices to improve the performance of its riders during the 2021 racing season. The two firms are also exploring the potential for augmented and virtual reality technologies to be incorporated into the design process for its motorbikes.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/7ddf741f5ce5bb93eb6f60b2bb282805","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-02-10T09:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"_Ve9DllVy","title":"Helpdesk meltdown due to absenteeism, low morale and increased workload","url":"https://www.computerweekly.com/news/252496080/Helpdesk-meltdown-due-to-absenteeism-low-morale-and-increased-workload","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/helpdesk-meltdown-due-to-absenteeism-low-morale-and-increased-workload--ve9dllvy","summary":"Remote working has led to an increase of 35% in monthly helpdesk ticket volumes. The cost of a support ticket has risen from $20.44 to $26.51. The mean time to resolve (MTTR) rose during the pandemic from 6.18 hours to 9.72 hours.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/66ee070b2f91f65f975e64b9264cee